WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.640
Studente: Ek wil my lewe verander!

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:03.610
O: I don't want to let my parents down!

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:07.000
S: Ek wil nie my ouers
in die steek laat nie!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.380
O: I don't ever want to
let my country down!

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:14.170
S: Ek wil nooit my land
in die steek laat nie!

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.600
O: Most importantly ... 
S: Belangrikste van als ...

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.290
O: I don't want to let myself down!

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:23.000
S: Ek wil nie myself
in die steek laat nie!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.240
JW: Hoeveel mense wêreldwyd
probeer tans Engels leer?

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.890
Twee miljard van hulle.

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:32.000
Studente: A T-shirt. A dress.